deo/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681270/extras/e4a05a9b61b39e88baf2f0744e277b48.mp4?t=1771898585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >retro 2bit pixel art &amp; cute hand drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >toy nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >figure out the unique styles of different ragdolls to get the top rating and secret unlockables!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode - No goals or \u201cgame over\u201d, express your creativity as you decorate your dollhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addicting text-based discovery\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every toy can interact with the dollhouses, have fun watching them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker and Idler lite mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoy the many furniture pieces to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the attic, make new friends, and bring this miniature world back to life in <strong>DIGI-DOLL</strong>!</p>","developers":["Holographicquad"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681270/57e5250ed92e49270a583b6bbaf3b2a652d384ce/header.jpg?t=1771898585","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3681270/930964102/a82b29f1315ce05600d2af4418c505be30c20a44/1750400426/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748760739","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3681270/930964102/a82b29f1315ce05600d2af4418c505be30c20a44/1750400426/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748760739","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3681270/93